<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

    <OAGene_Thought_SnowstormDepress.stages.0.label>暴风雪的压抑</OAGene_Thought_SnowstormDepress.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_SnowstormDepress.stages.0.description>密不透风的黑云，呼啸而过的狂风，这样的压抑几乎让我无法呼吸...我们真的能够活下去吗？</OAGene_Thought_SnowstormDepress.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Hediff_SnowstormAngry.stages.0.label>压抑的愤怒与不安</OAGene_Hediff_SnowstormAngry.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Hediff_SnowstormAngry.stages.0.description>这种不安感让我感到躁怒难耐，现在我只想一个人待一会。</OAGene_Hediff_SnowstormAngry.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_StormSleepAngry.stages.0.label>睡在多人宿舍中</OAGene_Thought_StormSleepAngry.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_StormSleepAngry.stages.0.description>够了，为什么哪怕连睡觉的时间我依然要和别人睡在一起？我需要能够让我喘息的空间！</OAGene_Thought_StormSleepAngry.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_UnderDark.stages.0.label>不见天日的黑暗</OAGene_Thought_UnderDark.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_UnderDark.stages.0.description>不要...我不要待在这种黑暗里，不要！</OAGene_Thought_UnderDark.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_StarryNight.stages.0.label>星月夜</OAGene_Thought_StarryNight.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_StarryNight.stages.0.description>这是何等瑰丽的月夜。</OAGene_Thought_StarryNight.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_SnowstormFog.stages.0.label>雪雾弥漫</OAGene_Thought_SnowstormFog.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_SnowstormFog.stages.0.description>即便现在我身旁存在着危险，恐怕我也无法发现。</OAGene_Thought_SnowstormFog.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_SnowstormFog.stages.1.label>雪雾弥漫</OAGene_Thought_SnowstormFog.stages.1.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_SnowstormFog.stages.1.description>我看不清东西了！什么都看不见！</OAGene_Thought_SnowstormFog.stages.1.description>

</LanguageData>